  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.41: Add offline eh change check-refresh against fresh entry snapshots and independent permission observations. Detect concurrent edits, missing/extra selections, already-current notes and locked/invoiced restrictions. Improve unresolved-workday annotations, identify explicit managed zero-labor claims, preserve original records and validate alpha.39/alpha.40 saved plans. Expand actual conflicting-rebase regression coverage and public annual cold/warm validation. Retry transient Windows snapshot checkpoint/publication replacement failures within a bounded cancellable wait while preserving existing files and permissions. Estimator priors, EHE values, fixed-eight allocations, rounding and rates are unchanged. EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated; missing original workdays and intermediate history require external evidence. No time-entry writes. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.41/CHANGELOG.md",
